sing the age for compulsory schooling, instituting school nutrition programs, and recognizing child rights.\\n\\nThe Useless Child\\n\\nFalling infant mortality rates during ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.representingchildhood.pitt.edu/twentycent_child.htm\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d202\"},\"ref\":\"d202\",\"snippet\":\" ... Havoc appeared occasionally on such successful television series as The Untouchables; Murder, She Wrote; McMillan & Wife; The Paper Chase; and The Outer Limits, as well as an arc on the popular soap opera General Hospital.\\n\\nPersonal life\\n\\nHavoc was married three times. Her first marriage, at age 16 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_Havoc\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1795efd4aed2c4ae5a17ae03093aa2d8254c3255eae966ae3e2c7ec640f6e6d3\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"715e4f93c9855c8367ccd2fe2e8553a245655c33d013ed5e21a2371996f8d3e3\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"television character three marriages one surviving child\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d203\"},\"ref\":\"d203\",\"snippet\":\" ... to their two children, to a widower who has to balance his work with being a single dad, to a remarried man and adoptive father to his new wife's little girl. Throughout it all, Danny manages to balance his life as an entertainer on the road with ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/best-tv-fathers-greatest-dads-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d204\"},\"ref\":\"d204\",\"snippet\":\" ... The data are based on linkages between the Utah Population Database and Medicare claims that hold medical diagnoses data. We show that offspring whose parents died when they were children, but especially when they were adolescents/young adults, have modest but significant mortality risks after age 65. What ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4087105/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d205\"},\"ref\":\"d205\",\"snippet\":\" ... She witnesses the Duchess's wedding and delivers her children. She dies tragically by strangling following the murder of the Duchess and the youngest children. Her name plays on the Italian carriolo, meaning \\\"trundle-bed\\\", where personal servants would have slept.\\n*Julia – Castruchio's wife and the Cardinal ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Duchess_of_Malfi\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d206\"},\"ref\":\"d206\",\"snippet\":\" ... Thomas also died at a young age.\\n\\nLincoln's father Thomas later remarried the widow Sarah Bush Johnston, who had three children of her own.\\n\\nChester Arthur was the oldest son in his family\\n\\nChester Arthur's birth was the cause for great celebration on the part of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/us-presidents-birth-order-2018-7\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d207\"},\"ref\":\"d207\",\"snippet\":\" ... If a spouse died during 2024 and the surviving spouse did not remarry in 2024, or if a spouse died in 2025 before filing a 2024 tax return, the surviving spouse can file as married filing joint. A joint return needs to show the 2024 income of the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.efile.com/qualifying-surviving-spouse/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"40a975319131af3e2d6bb541b58e101a04ef66d78b0f9fb76ff1eceec0717389\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"684ae1027042d982144d698541ea6e569bb119c996caba974a252761306c33c7\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"TV show character widowed remarried children died one survives\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_70087f4b8378496ca95e5604"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d111\"},\"ref\":\"d111\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/best-90s-cartoons/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":6000,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3000}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d112\"},\"ref\":\"d112\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.theatlantic.com/culture/archive/2024/12/best-tv-shows-2024-hacks-shogun-industry/680850/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/classic-tv-trivia-questions\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d113\"},\"ref\":\"d113\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/timothy-olyphant-best-movies-tv-shows/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Open a received ref with read; use replay=true to restore full cached navigation.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":7,\"prior_deliveries\":1,\"query_key\":\"7afc4fc6b60f2bd352b3832bbcc7828cca9d47d3cc14bbb6d1476e42eb59eb76\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"3d3c1e17b1d748cb4521f810b19a02810153237e6cf94648898757ded5932954\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"real life couple play unrelated characters same TV show\",\"view\":\"reuse\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d208\"},\"ref\":\"d208\",\"snippet\":\" ... unrelated individuals? How do you approach developing familial relationships?\\n\\nPart of the reason I like to write from sibling perspectives is because I'm one of four kids. My brothers and sister and I were very close growing up. To a certain extent, when we wanted to play ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.publishersweekly.com/pw/by-topic/childrens/childrens-authors/article/79644-q-a-with-margaret-peterson-haddix.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... One could easily believe them to be related in real life (Herina could easily be taken for Brown's (nonexistent) son), but they're not.\\n\\n- Gotham Knights (2023): Fallon Smythe and Tyler DiChiara play the Row siblings. The two look similar enough, especially their large dark eyes and ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d209\"},\"ref\":\"d209\",\"snippet\":\" ... A Psalm for the Wild-Built is listed as a \\\"Monk and Robot Book.\\\" Is this the beginning of a new series? Will it be like The Wayfarers series, with tangentially related stories within the same universe? Or will we be reading more stories about Dex & Mosscap?\\n\\nUnlike ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.lapl.org/collections-resources/blogs/lapl/interview-author-becky-chambers\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":6000,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3000}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... are siblings in real life are commonly cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... From this we get two variables, correlated to queenship, but unrelated to the state of conflict in the kingdom: queenship is correlated by the previous monarch failing have a male as their firstborn child, or by that monarch having a female sibling.\\n\\nAlthough there were cases in which ... \",\"title\":\"https://priceonomics.com/monarchs-more-belligerent-queens-kings/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"8c87e84ae9d813ca82d0dd0cff8845547eea25d64e6f104ca0840fecca1f0bc9\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7f87a31c