amas on cable. Through the first three seasons, the show Yellowstone appeared in the Top 10 movies and TV shows. The show is massively successful so there ... \",\"title\":\"https://morethanjustparks.com/national-park-tv-shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... John who carries on the legacy, but Michelle Randolph, whose character Elizabeth married Spencer's nephew, Jack, isn't so sure.\\n\\nJack (Darren Mann) and Elizabeth Dutton (Michelle Randolph)\\n\\nAfter five seasons of Yellowstone and trips back in time to 1883 and 1923, one over-arching question remained ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/feature/yellowstone-character-guide-dutton-family-tree-1235593911/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d150\"},\"ref\":\"d150\",\"snippet\":\" ... existing seasons of Yellowstone depend on it.\\n\\nThere was never a large \\\"W\\\" on the side of the bunkhouse. John Dutton (Kevin Costner) spoke with pride of his family owning the land for nearly 150 years.\\n\\nWho lives, who dies and (most important) who survives to raise the ... \",\"title\":\"https://tasteofcountry.com/1923-ending-season-2-episode-1-breakdown-dutton-rules/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d151\"},\"ref\":\"d151\",\"snippet\":\" ... Then later on, after the death of John, Kayce becomes the ranch's new owner.\\n\\nCharacter profile[]\\n\\nKayce Dutton, son of John Dutton and a former Navy SEAL, is a complex and compelling character in the hit TV show Yellowstone. Throughout the series, Kayce grapples with the inherent ... \",\"title\":\"https://yellowstone.fandom.com/wiki/Kayce_Dutton\"},{\"kind\":\"naviga