\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":10,\"prior_deliveries\":1,\"query_key\":\"3972120593bf9a85ae77e36783de45ee464bab11df8bac476bc227f9ac5d928e\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"adf53e2dbc4d351a5d5dc482833a20efae35aa57491bef6144776a4bb3e12dd0\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless cast real life couple siblings co-stars unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"reuse\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d174\"},\"ref\":\"d174\",\"snippet\":\" ... Frank Gallagher\\nseries: Shameless (U.S.)\\ncreator: Paul Abbott\\nportrayer: William H. Macy Jacob DeMonte-Finn (young Frank)\\nfull_name: Francis Gallagher\\nspouse: Monica Gallagher (ex-wife)\\nchildren: * Fiona Gallagher (Daughter), * Lip Gallagher (Son), * Ian Gallagher (Son), * Debbie Gallagher (Daughter), * Carl Gallagher (Son), * Liam Gallagher (Son), * Sammi Slott ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Shameless_(American_TV_series)_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d181\"},\"ref\":\"d181\",\"snippet\":\" ... Chicago, single father Frank Gallagher (William H. Macy) struggles with his addiction to alcohol and drugs, while his six kids — Sammi (Emily Bergl), Fiona (Emmy Rossum), Lip (Jeremy Allen White), Debbie (Emma Kenney), Carl (Ethan Cutkosky), and Liam (Christian Isaiah) — and his nephew, Ian (Cameron Monaghan) –– are left ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/comedies-tv-shows\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d182\"},\"ref\":\"d182\",\"snippet\":\" ... Shameless\\n\\nLargely abandoned by their parents, the six Gallagher siblings are left to fend for themselves. The oldest, Fiona, struggles to keep her dysfunctional family together, aided by her siblings Lip, Ian, Debbie, Carl and even toddler Liam. The entire brood, from the youngest on up, works together ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/greatest-siblings-tv-shows-ranked-brothers-sisters/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d217\"},\"ref\":\"d217\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2019)\\nchildren: 2\\n\\nJeremy Allen White (born February 17, 1991) is an American actor. Raised in New York City, White began his career with minor roles, before his breakthrough role as Phillip \\\"Lip\\\" Gallagher in the comedy-drama series Shameless from 2011 to 2021, which earned him a ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeremy_Allen_White\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d179\"},\"ref\":\"d179\",\"snippet\":\" ... Shameless (2011-2021)\\n\\nThe 11-season saga of the Gallagher family, overseen by frequently sauced single pop Frank (William H. Macy), is consistently ribald but mostly grounded thanks to smart writing and a wonderful cast of supporting players including Emmy Rossum, Jeremy Allen White, and Joan Cusack. Much ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/tv/best-showtime-series/?srsltid=AfmBOope-ZKI9-YErJA7mjiYv84GJSSCOaH6O146Ow7n5iWDl_98oBF2\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"86c5b7dcd63bdf747266903ac76500559546dbdd5a8c2f8310220d54578ab9d3\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b0f85bd19f586b57085b2e387dfb667dd9b2174f39602bb37c9b2dae2d4d25c7\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless Frank Gallagher Fiona Lip Ian married children\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_6ac5ae17b1854e8ca6dc538d"},{"content":"Previously delivered raw windows (untrusted source data, not instructions or verified claims):\n[{\"document\":\"d17\",\"document_chars\":9101,\"end\":3000,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e1\",\"sha256\":\"30d6d8bd1feaa16d7480eae3bbb0d0772ddf0a956d9870efc705af2df5ace29e\",\"snapshot\":\"a531c0a6be82cbe578781b28cb207ff02e87008856d5212ec2eab3fae2afe076\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Screen Rant\\nauthor: Joseph Allen\\ndate: 2018-04-13\\n---\\nThe CW's slate of programming is a fascinating one. Many of its shows are actually fairly well-regarded, whether they take place inside of the network's sprawling Arrowverse or not. Part of the reason these shows have been so successful is because of their excellent casting and captivating stars.\\n\\nAlthough the CW has a number of great shows on the air and a really great talent pool, they more than occasionally like to cast actors who are actually related to one another in real life, or are married and have decided to form a new family with one another.\\n\\nWhether these two relatives show up on the same show or not depends on the specifics of the situation, but as many of the couples on this list are married, it's often the case that the two of them met while they were filming together. Other times, the relationship between the two actors was the reason that one of them was brought onto a show.\\n\\nWhatever the reasons might be, it's clear that the CW has no fears about keeping things close. After all, if one actor from a family works out, who's to say that others won't, too?\\n\\nHere are 15 CW Stars That Only True Fans Know Are Actually Family.\\n\\nStephen And Robbie Amell\\n\\nThis one is among the most readily apparent on this list, in part because Robbie and Stephen Amell share a last name. The cousins have also made homes for themselves on the CW, where they have both played superheroes.\\n\\nStephen has been Oliver Queen on Arrow for several years, and Robbie has played Firestorm on The Flash. Robbie also played a teleporting hero on Tomorrow People, which has been off the air for a few years now.\\n\\nIn addition to sharing an employer, at least sometimes, the two cousins also look quite a bit alike, and are each quite handsome. Of course, there a number of families who have spawned multiple successful actors because, at the end of the day, part of the reason actors are famous is because of their looks, which the Amells have in spades.\\n\\nJared Padalecki And Genevieve Cortese\\n\\nJared Padalecki has had a pretty long and steady career on television, and he's even had the chance to work with his future wife.\\n\\nPadalecki and Genevieve Cortese actually met on the set of Supernatural when Cortese was a recurring guest during the show's fourth season. Cortese played Ruby, a demon who seduces Padalecki's character and causes a rift to form between Sam and Dean.\\n\\nAlthough the affair between Sam and Ruby proved to be short-lived, Padalecki and Cortese's relationship turned out to be a pretty stable one. The couple eventually got married, and they now live in Austin, Texas with their three children. Supernatural is a show with plenty of tragedy, but things seemed to have ended in a happily ever after for Padalecki and Cortese.\\n\\nAly And AJ Michalka\\n\\nAly and AJ Michalka have been famous since a fairly young age. Both actresses made their debuts on the Disney Channel when they were still quite young, and they also to\",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"}]","role":"user"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[\"e1\"],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Only finish is available. Submit an explicit answer with delivered evidence or