is the longest-running medical drama on television. Though it revolves around lead character Meredith Grey, the drama focuses on a group of\",\"title\":\"https://nursingeducation.org/blog/25-best-tv-shows/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d212\"},\"ref\":\"d212\",\"snippet\":\" ... broadcast for the actor best known as McDreamy on Grey's Anatomy. Although, it must be said, this does not sound very McDreamy at all.\\n\\n\\\"Memory of a Killer\",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3758542/news/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d211\"},\"ref\":\"d211\",\"snippet\":\" ... As long as I still get my degree, it's fine.'\\\"\\n\\nPresently, Michael is a part of the Bravo universe, as Andy Cohen announced in July 2023 that Michael works\",\"title\":\"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/a26803015/kelly-ripa-kids-husband-mark-consuelos/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d210\"},\"ref\":\"d210\",\"snippet\":\" ... She played the role of \\\"Nibbles\\\" on \\\"Married with Children\\\" in 1992. Bryan Brown was born on the 23rd June, 1947 and he is an Australian actor who married \",\"title\":\"https://www.funtrivia.com/quizzes/people/name_game/same_surname.html\"}],\"consecutive_repeat_rounds\":0,\"contract\":{\"enabled\":true,\"gap_state\":true,\"guided_read\":true,\"recovery_rounds\":2,\"repeat_threshold\":2,\"repetition\":\"bounded\",\"reuse_results\":true,\"version\":\"gap-workflow-v1\"},\"instruction\":\"Use the current missing relation to choose a real next action. Page-name search is not page reading; cached is not proof of progress.\",\"last_new_navigation_source_round\":15,\"last_new_raw_source_round\":12,\"previous_gap_judgments_not_verified\":[],\"recovery_decisions_used\":0,\"stage\":\"normal\"},\"retriever_capabilities\":{\"boolean_operators\":false,\"kind\":\"sqlite-fts5-bm25\",\"negative_result\":\"no hit fo